~ start
if QuestService.is_completed_offered()
	=> completed
elif QuestService.is_ready_offered()
	=> ready
elif QuestService.is_accepted_offered()
	=> in_progress
else
	Steward: I walk, talk, offer a greeting, and sell a potion.
	- I will take the greeting.
		do QuestService.request_accept_offered()
		=> END
	- Not now.
		Steward: The loop continues when we are done talking.
		=> END
	- Show me your stock.
		do VendorService.open_from_dialogue()
		=> END

~ in_progress
Steward: Speak with me again and I can close the errand.
- Show me your stock.
	do VendorService.open_from_dialogue()
	=> END

~ ready
Steward: That greeting is complete. I can take it.
- Turn it in.
	do QuestService.request_turn_in_offered()
	=> END
- Show me your stock.
	do VendorService.open_from_dialogue()
	=> END

~ completed
Steward: The combined proof is done. Goods remain for sale.
- Show me your stock.
	do VendorService.open_from_dialogue()
	=> END
